create will be distributed to the people of Kyungsung, and your decisions will become a piece of history.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Story:</strong> A solid storyline set against the backdrop of Kyungsung in the 1910s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRPG-style Progression:</strong> Experience fated choices and outcomes through dice rolling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Mini-games:</strong> Mini-games linked to actual reporting methods add to the fun of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Newspaper Editing:</strong> Lay out and publish your newspaper in your own unique style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings Based on Player's Choices:</strong> Your decisions will change history.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What History will You Record?</strong></p>","developers":["divingstudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930370/9ec78176ebaae6d9be7e562554a0f18f2e0e02f8/header.jpg?t=1765010747","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930370/1723725546/f7bd878f160cf81fd92843eaac4e1b0c544d43d5/1754709158/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755044917","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930370/1723725546/f7bd878f160cf81fd92843eaac4e1b0c544d43d5/1754709158/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755044917","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930370/1723725546/f7bd878f160cf81fd92843eaac4e1b0c544d43d5/1754709158/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755044917","id":257180663,"name":"\uadf8\ub0a0\uc758\uc2e0\ubb38 \ud2b8\ub808\uc77c\ub7ec","thumbnail":"https://shared.ak